{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-c694c03d6c0d0de57538bfe96813a39366c23687fa594080","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"3d8147ef67bc736ffcb69fd1d42cc2832a3164e682fb74fa76a8df4fe5717cc3","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Attached Form No. 17] <Amended on April 5, 2007>\n\n(Front)\n\nDisposal of Articles Exempt from Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax\n[ ] Application for Approval  [ ] Approval\n\nProcessing period: 5 days.\n\nApplicant (Receiving Party)\n\n| ① Name (representative) | ② Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ③ Business name (corporate name) | ④ Telephone number |\n| | |\n| ⑤ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| ⑥ Place of entry or installation | ⑦ Business registration number |\n| | |\n\nDetails of Application\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>⑧ Name of article</th><th>⑨ Quantity</th><th>⑩ Specifications</th><th>⑪ Unit price</th><th>⑫ Price</th><th>⑬ Tax rate</th><th>⑭ Tax amount</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nReleasing Party\n\n| ⑮ Name or business name (corporate name) | |\n|---|---|\n| ⑯ Address or location of manufacturing place | |\n\n| ⑰ Reason for entry | |\n|---|---|\n| ⑱ Date of entry | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ |\n| ⑲ Reason for disposal | |\n| ⑳ Matters for reference | |\n\nAs the above articles cannot be used for the prescribed purpose, I apply for approval to dispose of them pursuant to Article 23 (3) of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office\n\nNo. ______\n\nDisposal of the tax-exempt articles is approved as stated above.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nHead of the Tax Office: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\nRequired documents: None.\n※ This application form is distributed free of charge.\nFee: None.\n\nGeneral paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare application</td><td>2. Receive application (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide (Final decision delegated to the department head)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>5. Prepare approval certificate (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe application proceeds from box 1 to box 2 on the right, then downward through boxes 3, 4, and 5. The final arrow from box 5 runs left and upward to the applicant and is labelled “Issue approval certificate.”\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\16c6d617c56f2dc77f0bfab36622a97219e953ce5e6f56f8b1f9257268fc967c.ascii.json","sha256":"16c6d617c56f2dc77f0bfab36622a97219e953ce5e6f56f8b1f9257268fc967c"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_co